#201  S to toolchange position
#202  Z to toolchange position
#203  Y to toolchange position
#204  X to toolchange position
#205  Tool lock open
#206  Tool lock close
#207  Tool pliers spindle open
#208  Tool pliers spindle close
#209  Tool pliers magazine open
#210  Tool pliers magazine close
#211  Tool unclamping
#212  Tool clamping
#213  Tool arm to spindle
#214  Tool arm to magazine
#215  Tool arm to basic position
#216  Tool arm put out
#217  Tool arm put in
#218  Tool arm turn cw (right)
#219  Tool arm turn ccw (left)
#220  Magazine turn cw (right)
#221  Magazine turn ccw (left)
#222  Magazine reference
#223  Delete spindle status (T0)
